{title: Ye To Sach Hai Ki Bhagwaan Hai}
{artist: Hariharan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Yeh to sach hai ki bhagwan [C]hai,        Hai [Am]magar phir bhee anjan [E]hai
[Am]Dharati pe roop ma bap [C]ka,        [E]Us vidhata ki [G]pehchan [Am]hai
[Am]Janmdata hai jo,        nam [E]jinse mila
Thamkar [G]jinaki unglee hai,        [Am]bachpan chala
[Am]Kandhe par baithke,        jinke [E]dekha jahan
Gyan [G]jinse mila kya,        [Am]bura kya bhala
[Am]Itne upkar hain kya [C]kahe,        [Am]Yeh batana naa aasan [E]hai
[Am]Dharati pe roop ma bap [C]ka,        [E]Us vidhata ki [G]pehchan [Am]hai
[Am]Janam deti hai jo,        ma [E]jise jag kahe
Apanee [G]santan mein,        [Am]pran jiske rahe
[Am]Loriya hothon par,        sapne [E]bunatee najar
Nind [G]jo var de,        [Am]hanske har dukh sahe
[Am]Mamta ke rup me hai [C]prabhu,        [Am]Aapse paya vardan [E]hai
[Am]Dharati pe roop ma bap [C]ka,        [E]Us vidhata ki [G]pehchan [Am]hai
